vchi Quloqlik</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"order amount and date block\">\n<span class=\"oamt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"order amount\">640 000 UZS</span>\n<span class=\"odate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"order date\">8 Nov · 15:30</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-open\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"review order button\">Review order</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"orow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"order row\">\n<div class=\"o-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"order identity block\">\n<span class=\"ono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"order number\">NX-858</span>\n<span class=\"ostate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"order state label\"><span class=\"dot ok\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"state indicator dot\"></span>Confirmed</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-mid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"order customer and product block\">\n<span class=\"ocust\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"order customer name\">Shaxzod Aliyev</span>\n<span class=\"oprod\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"order product name\">Minimalist Aqlli Soat (Chronos Pro)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"order amount and date block\">\n<span class=\"oamt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"order amount\">890 000 UZS</span>\n<span class=\"odate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"order date\">9 Nov · 13:03</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-open\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"review order button\">Review order</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"orow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"order row\">\n<div class=\"o-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"order identity block\">\n<span class=\"ono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"order number\">NX-857</span>\n<span class=\"ostate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"order state label\"><span class=\"dot ok\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"state indicator dot\"></span>Delivered</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-mid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"order customer and product block\">\n<span class=\"ocust\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"order customer name\">Nilufar Rahimova</span>\n<span class=\"oprod\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"order product name\">Klassik Teri Sumka (Milano Tote)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"order amount and date block\">\n<span class=\"oamt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"order amount\">499 000 UZS</span>\n<span class=\"odate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"order date\">9 Nov · 11:42</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-open\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"review order button\">Review order</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"orow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"order row\">\n<div class=\"o-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"order identity block\">\n<span class=\"ono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"order number\">NX-856</span>\n<span class=\"ostate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"order state label\"><span class=\"dot ok\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"state indicator dot\"></span>Confirmed</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-mid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"order customer and product block\">\n<span class=\"ocust\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"order customer name\">Bobur Mansurov</span>\n<span class=\"oprod\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"order product name\">Oversize Jun Palto (Winter Cashmere)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"order amount and date block\">\n<span class=\"oamt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"order amount\">1 250 000 UZS</span>\n<span class=\"odate\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"order date\">8 Nov · 19:15</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-open\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-4\" data-name=\"review order button\">Review order</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maint\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"maintenance section grid\">\n<section class=\"panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"stock panel\">\n<div class=\"p-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"stock panel header\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"stock panel title\">Stock</h2>\n<span class=\"threshold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"stock threshold indicator\">Stock ≤ 5</span>\n<div class=\"sp\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"panel header spacer\"></div>\n<a class=\"link\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-4\" data-name=\"open products link\">Open products <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"arrow up right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"srow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"low stock item row\">\n<span class=\"dot stop\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stock status dot\"></span>\n<span class=\"sname\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"low stock product name\">Skandinav Dizayn Kursisi (Nordic Oak)</span>\n<span class=\"ssku\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"product SKU\">NX-CHAIR-12</span>\n<span class=\"sqty\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"low stock quantity\">5 units</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"agent status panel\">\n<div class=\"m-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"agent status panel header\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"agent status panel title\">Agent status</h2>\n<div class=\"sp\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"panel header spacer\"></div>\n<a class=\"link\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"open settings link\">Open settings <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow up right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"agent row: answering status\">\n<span class=\"icon-i\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"agent row icon container\"><i class=\"icon-bot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"bot icon\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"hk\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"agent feature key\">Answering</span>\n<span class=\"hv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"agent feature value\"><span class=\"dot ok\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"status indicator dot\"></span>Enabled</span>\n<span class=\"cv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"agent row chevron affordance\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"agent row: webhook status\">\n<span class=\"icon-i\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"agent row icon container\"><i class=\"icon-shield-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"hk\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"agent feature key\">Webhook subscription</span>\n<span class=\"hv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"agent feature value\">Active</span>\n<span class=\"cv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-4\" data-name=\"agent row chevron affordance\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4\" data-name=\"agent row: meta token expiry\">\n<span class=\"icon-i\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"agent row icon container\"><i class=\"icon-clock\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"hk\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"agent feature key\">Meta token</span>\n<span class=\"hv mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-3\" data-name=\"meta token remaining days\">54 days left</span>\n<span class=\"cv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-4\" data-name=\"agent row chevron affordance\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5\" data-name=\"agent row: Instagram account\">\n<span class=\"icon-i\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-1\" data-name=\"agent row icon container\"><i class=\"bi bi-instagram\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"Instagram icon\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"hk\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-2\" data-name=\"agent feature key\">Instagram account</span>\n<span class=\"hv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-3\" data-name=\"agent feature value\">Connected</span>\n<span class=\"cv\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-4\" data-name=\"agent row chevron affordance\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</div>",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-10T15:06:15.452486+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-10T15:14:25.784301+00:00",
